e. Every player of a club moves by one whole number and its best few by one more, held to 1–99 and never past a teammate rated above him, whichever brings the club nearest its target: −4 to +3 points this season. The results count twice, by design: the credit's points for and against place a club's players at their positions and weigh its offence against its defence, and the move then sets the club's level from its margins, wherever the credit left it. Facts from Pro Football Archives; the weights tuned once on 2001–2005 against the next season's Madden launch ratings, then frozen."},"map":"nfl1997","clubs":[{"id":"nfl-kansas-city-chiefs","name":"Kansas City Chiefs","code":"KCC","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 144)","str":84.3,"squad":[["Elvis Grbac","QB",79],["Rich Gannon","QB",74],["Kimble Anders","RB",87],["Greg Hill","RB",86],["Andre Rison","WR",92],["Lake Dawson","WR",77],["Danan Hughes","WR",67],["Tamarick Vanover","WR",66],["Ted Popson","TE",78],["Derrick Walker","TE",71],["Dave Szott","OL",93],["Jeff Criswell","OL",93],["Tim Grunhard","OL",93],["Will Shields","OL",93],["Glenn Parker","OL",80],["Trezelle Jenkins","OL",59],["Ralph Tamm","OL",56],["Dan Williams","DL",78],["John Browning","DL",78],["Vaughn Booker","DL",78],["Joe Phillips","DL",74],["Tom Barndt","DL",65],["Kerry Hicks","DL",54],["Derrick Thomas","LB",89],["Donnie Edwards","LB",89],["Anthony Davis","LB",86],["James Hasty","CB",90],["Dale Carter","CB",82],["Mark McMillian","CB",73],["Darren Anderson","CB",68],["Jerome Woods","S",92],["Reggie Tongue","S",86],["Todd Scott","S",57],["Pete Stoyanovich","K",99]]},{"id":"nfl-detroit-lions","name":"Detroit Lions","code":"DET","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 263)","str":82.2,"squad":[["Scott Mitchell","QB",82],["Frank Reich","QB",52],["Barry Sanders","RB",99],["Tommy Vardell","RB",77],["Herman Moore","WR",92],["Johnnie Morton","WR",85],["Tommie Boyd","WR",64],["Glyn Milburn","WR",63],["David Sloan","TE",75],["Pet